  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut sweet potato into fries.\n• Place fries on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Bake until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62c3e7ee27a33cab7905a79a/step-2cf1254a.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, drain sweetcorn.\n• Heat a large frying pan over high heat. Cook corn kernels until lightly browned, 4-5 minutes.\n• Transfer to a medium bowl. TIP: Cover the pan with a lid if the kernels are \"popping\" out.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62c3e7ee27a33cab7905a79a/step-bd594911.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• In a shallow bowl, combine the plain flour and garlic & herb seasoning.\n• In a second shallow bowl, whisk the egg.\n• In a third shallow bowl, place panko breadcrumbs.\n• Dip haloumi slices into the flour mixture to coat, then into the egg, and finally in the breadcrumbs. Set aside on a plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62c3e7ee27a33cab7905a79a/step-2f93e5eb.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice celery.\n• To the bowl with the charred corn, add slaw mix, celery and ranch dressing.\n• Toss to combine. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62c3e7ee27a33cab7905a79a/step-2f725f94.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the fries have 5-10 minutes remaining, return frying pan to medium-high heat with enough olive oil to coat the base.\n• When oil is hot, cook haloumi until golden brown, 2 minutes each side.\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62c3e7ee27a33cab7905a79a/step-b4657713.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide garlicky crumbed haloumi, sweet potato fries and charred corn slaw between plates.\n• Serve with garlic aioli. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62c3e7ee27a33cab7905a79a/step-a50b65b5.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
